# rungun: "trash" on top of the screen

- Source URL: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores/issues/1269

## Issue Title
rungun: "trash" on top of the screen

## Issue Description
On the second visible line of the screen, sometimes some weird graphics are drawn in the objects layer.

This effect is not seen in a short scene simulation.

Through a longer simulation, it is seen that this occurs when an object is at the bottom of the screen. The last line drawn for this object in jtframe_obj_buffer is not read, and therefore not deleted, until the top of the following frame is read, producing this effect.

